    "Appearance": {
      "comment": "SettingsView.swift:166",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apariencia"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "As victims...er...users practiced their markdown, they'd press the render button to check out how the HTML structure was being formed. Yet every time they went to inspect the rendered output, things would be off.": {
      "comment": "WhyGhostWriterView.swift:19",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mientras las víctimas... ejem... las personas usuarias practicaban Markdown, pulsaban el botón Renderizar para comprobar cómo se formaba la estructura HTML. Sin embargo, cada vez que examinaban el resultado renderizado, algo no estaba bien."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask for a Title": {
      "comment": "NewDocumentCreationMode.swift:19",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pedir un título"
